      "width": "380px",
      "right": "275px",
      "text": "כל חמש ושורפין בתחלת שש דכ\"ע <i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Leavened and Unleavened Bread\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>מיהת חמץ",
      "segment_ids": [
